To: Marta Kowalska
Subject: Missing ADR documents UN 1263 - Antwerp

Marta, we found two outbound shipments in Antwerp this week without ADR trans=
port documents. Both contain paint, UN 1263 (class 3). Delivery 80451233 (12 =
pallets) was found on 29 Sep, delivery 80451290 (8 pallets) on 30 Sep. In bot=
h cases the truck was already at the dock and the dangerous goods declaration=
 was not in the shipment folder. We held the trucks until the paperwork was p=
rinted, which cost about 2.5 hours in total. Nothing left the site without do=
cuments, but it was close. Can you help me define what must be checked before=
 loading?

Kind regards,
Sofie Peeters
Warehouse supervisor Antwerp
